    "score": 0.25,
    "summary": "This explicitly hypothetical fixture describes a comparison of query expansion and a fixed retriever on 40 English questions. Query expansion answered 30 questions correctly versus 28 for the fixed retriever, but each method was run once. Since the document identifies itself as a software-loop and citation-format fixture rather than a real paper, it provides little substantive research value; its reported comparison is also preliminary.",
